<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap rises to 397 bps,302 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap rises to 397 bps,302 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year</p>
<p>bond over bunds widened to 397 basis points today from 381 on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also increased to 302 basis points from</p>
<p>288 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.58%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.60%	398	381 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.46%	412	395 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.56%	302	288 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.34%	324	314 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.26%	332	317 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.19%	239	221 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.32%	326	305 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1416</p>
<p>GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
